silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_26_circuit_imprint_tensor_sections_03_tensor_construction_concrete_anchor_0#t11_tensor silm:hasLongDescription "The T11_tensor is the rank-3 binary tensor T_11 for paper 11: T_11 in {0,1}^{2x2x2}, with 8 corner coordinates each instantiated by one functor iota_{scl}. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'T11_tensor', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
